{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52720","headline":"丹元子步天歌 东方七宿 二 · 王希明","name":"丹元子步天歌 东方七宿 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"亢，四星恰如弯弓状。\n大角一星直上明，折威七子亢下横。\n大角左右摄提星，三三相似如鼎形。\n折威下左顿顽星，两个斜安黄色精。\n顽下二星号阳门，色若顿顽直下𨀛","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王希明","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52720.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52720","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}